  "widgets": [
    {
      "definition": {
        "background_color": "transparent",
        "content": "The estate watching its own meters. **Read the ceiling tiles at the Month-to-Date timeframe** — their color bands assume a monthly window. `datadog.estimated_usage.*` lags real usage by up to a few hours. Fixed budget lines not on a meter here: CI Visibility $8/mo (1 committer, 400k pipeline spans included — no per-span usage metric exists on this account), synthetics ~$1.44/mo, RUM <$1/mo. Threshold bands are provisional (RC1-348) — true ceilings live on [Plan & Usage](https://app.datadoghq.com/account/usage). Spend on model calls has its own watchdog: the [fleet spend guardrail](https://app.datadoghq.com/monitors/318097614).",
        "font_size": "14",
        "has_padding": true,
        "show_tick": false,
        "text_align": "left",
        "type": "note"
      },
      "id": 7139675416423771,
      "layout": {
        "height": 2,
        "width": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
